module sizes .
rem run: advance 5 -8
rem run: third32 1.0
rem run: same_third 1.0 1.0

rem ko: usize · idiff — 길이 · 첨자와 그 차이. 폭은 구현이 정한다(16 비트 이상). 다른 정수와는 cast 로만 오간다 /// en: usize and idiff are for lengths, indexes and their differences; the implementation sets the width (16 bits or more), and they cross to other integers through cast only
fn advance input n usize . input k idiff . output idiff .
  requires le n. 1000 . .
  requires ge k. -1000 . .
  requires le k. 1000 . .
do
  return add cast idiff n. . k. . .
end .

rem ko: f32 — 32 비트 부동소수점. 메모리가 절반이고 정밀도는 약 일곱 자리 /// en: f32 is a 32-bit float: half the memory, about seven significant digits
fn third32 input x f32 . output f32 . do
  return div x. 3.0 . .
end .

rem ko: 같은 1/3 도 f32 와 f64 는 다른 수다 — 넓혀서 비교하면 거짓 /// en: even 1/3 is a different number in f32 and f64; widened and compared, they are not equal
fn same_third input x f32 . input y f64 . output bool . do
  let a f32 div x. 3.0 . .
  let b f64 div y. 3.0 . .
  return eq widen f64 a. . b. . .
end .
